# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# PHASE 1 — AUTHENTICATION
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Your SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY above is already picked up as the browser
# (anon) key, so login will work as-is. Optionally add the explicit name:
#
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<same value as SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY>
#
# RECOMMENDED — add your service_role key so the server can act as an
# admin in later phases. Supabase -> Project Settings -> API -> service_role
# This key must NEVER be sent to the browser.
#
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=<your service_role key>
#
# NOTE: the line "SUPERBASE API_URL=..." above is not a valid env variable
# (it has a space in the name) and is ignored. Safe to delete.
